WEBVTT

01:42.320 --> 01:43.200
Take a photo with Auntie.

01:44.160 --> 01:45.520
For the memories.

01:45.520 --> 01:46.680
You finally came back.

01:48.200 --> 01:48.640
Come on.

01:50.360 --> 01:51.720
One, two, three.

01:52.080 --> 01:52.520
Good.

01:53.080 --> 01:53.440
Okay.

01:53.520 --> 01:54.600
Stay here for a bit.

01:54.640 --> 01:55.680
I'll go cook.

02:10.000 --> 02:10.880
Ye is back.

02:12.840 --> 02:13.360
First, you need to

02:13.360 --> 02:14.040
solve the issue here.

02:14.040 --> 02:14.800
Only after that,

02:14.800 --> 02:16.120
you could bring this on.

02:16.440 --> 02:18.040
Pay attention to the ratio

02:18.400 --> 02:19.120
between the front and the rear.

02:19.600 --> 02:20.520
Go back and compare it

02:20.520 --> 02:21.079
with that plan again.

02:21.440 --> 02:22.600
Okay. Thanks, Engineer Xing.

02:34.240 --> 02:35.600
Booked the earliest flight tomorrow.

02:39.240 --> 02:40.240
Look at these dishes.

02:40.720 --> 02:42.200
See if they're still your favorites.

02:42.920 --> 02:44.000
Now,

02:44.120 --> 02:45.760
I don't cook with lard anymore.

02:46.000 --> 02:47.079
So don't worry. Eat up.

02:47.880 --> 02:49.960
I've missed this taste.

02:50.880 --> 02:51.360
It's just...

02:51.920 --> 02:53.280
Isn't it too much?

02:53.320 --> 02:54.280
The two of us can't finish it.

02:54.800 --> 02:56.280
Here in Zhazhating,

02:56.400 --> 02:58.760
food never goes unfinished.

02:59.120 --> 02:59.600
Come on.

03:00.240 --> 03:00.840
Lanfang.

03:01.280 --> 03:01.840
Fangfang.

03:02.320 --> 03:02.760
Right on time.

03:02.760 --> 03:04.600
Auntie Shanxi. Auntie Yufen.

03:04.640 --> 03:05.280
Ye.

03:05.600 --> 03:06.600
It's been so long.

03:06.840 --> 03:07.520
Sit down. Sit down.

03:08.160 --> 03:09.920
What a feast you two made.

03:10.320 --> 03:11.360
Great.

03:11.360 --> 03:12.600
Food is all ready for us.

03:14.000 --> 03:15.440
Eat, eat. I'm starving.

03:16.200 --> 03:16.520
Thank you.

03:16.520 --> 03:17.680
The food is good today.

03:17.680 --> 03:18.280
Not bad.

03:19.200 --> 03:19.560
Here.

03:19.760 --> 03:20.240
Ye.

03:20.560 --> 03:22.600
At Big G's wedding, it was packed.

03:22.600 --> 03:23.760
We didn't get to talk to you.

03:24.160 --> 03:25.560
Today, let's have a proper chat.

03:25.640 --> 03:26.800
Yes. Today,

03:26.800 --> 03:28.840
let's drink and catch up properly.

03:29.720 --> 03:31.400
I was just talking with Lanfang

03:31.400 --> 03:32.400
about a project.

03:32.760 --> 03:33.680
This time,

03:33.880 --> 03:34.520
I came with

03:34.520 --> 03:36.160
a rural-support project for Chang Island.

03:37.079 --> 03:37.800
My company

03:37.800 --> 03:39.440
wants to expand

03:39.520 --> 03:40.680
Chang Island's industrial chain.

03:44.440 --> 03:46.280
This is the planning report.

03:47.560 --> 03:49.000
This is wonderful, Ye.

03:49.680 --> 03:50.880
We're thinking the same thing.

03:51.160 --> 03:51.600
Really.

03:51.960 --> 03:52.880
I've noticed lately

03:53.120 --> 03:55.120
Livestreams for local farmers are a hit.

03:55.560 --> 03:56.280
I was thinking

03:56.320 --> 03:57.440
whether I could

03:57.840 --> 03:58.720
try livestreaming too.

03:59.600 --> 04:01.280
We have so much seafood here.

04:01.840 --> 04:03.120
I could show everyone

04:03.120 --> 04:04.400
how to cook seafood

04:04.440 --> 04:05.160
and how to eat it.

04:05.520 --> 04:07.720
My seafood noodles...

04:08.280 --> 04:09.800
Can I turn them into a brand?

04:10.040 --> 04:11.240
Of course you can.

04:11.520 --> 04:13.360
Livestream e-commerce is huge now.

04:13.440 --> 04:14.720
You can livestream and sell products.

04:15.000 --> 04:15.680
It could even make

04:15.680 --> 04:16.640
Zhazhating popular.

04:16.920 --> 04:17.320
Exactly.

04:17.399 --> 04:19.120
If you really start livestreaming,

04:20.000 --> 04:21.399
I'll send viewers to your stream.

04:22.120 --> 04:22.680
Although

04:22.720 --> 04:24.280
I don't have that many followers,

04:24.440 --> 04:25.680
I'll still send viewers your way.

04:26.600 --> 04:28.440
Lanfang, you're a big influencer.

04:29.440 --> 04:30.600
50,000 followers, a real influencer!

04:32.600 --> 04:33.840
If you really go live,

04:33.960 --> 04:35.320
I'll be there to click likes

04:35.520 --> 04:36.560
and gifts.

04:36.640 --> 04:37.520
I'll send you sports cars.

04:37.800 --> 04:38.280
Yufen.

04:38.280 --> 04:38.880
Oh my.

04:38.960 --> 04:39.720
So generous.

04:39.920 --> 04:40.600
Absolutely.

04:40.640 --> 04:41.520
Auntie Shanxi,

04:41.520 --> 04:42.400
are you starting

04:42.400 --> 04:43.440
a second act in your career?

04:44.280 --> 04:44.880
I support you.

04:45.280 --> 04:46.640
No second act.

04:46.840 --> 04:49.120
Mainly, Ye, you inspired me.

04:49.440 --> 04:50.600
And isn't the country

04:50.600 --> 04:51.200
strongly developing

04:51.200 --> 04:52.520
the marine economy now?

04:52.960 --> 04:54.120
We should do our part.

04:54.240 --> 04:54.800
Absolutely.

04:54.960 --> 04:57.200
The three beauties of Zhazhating,

04:57.520 --> 04:59.240
if you want to do something,

04:59.400 --> 05:00.960
there's nothing you can't do.

05:01.040 --> 05:01.920
Yes, yes.

05:02.080 --> 05:02.440
Right.

05:02.520 --> 05:02.920
Come on.

05:03.240 --> 05:03.880
To the three beauties.

05:04.200 --> 05:04.680
Good.

05:04.720 --> 05:06.440
Cheers.

06:01.520 --> 06:02.720
Of course you do.

06:03.240 --> 06:04.840
When you fix phones,

06:04.840 --> 06:05.760
you're always looking down.

06:06.200 --> 06:07.240
That's bad for your neck.

06:12.920 --> 06:13.440
Fine.

06:14.320 --> 06:15.520
Then I'll wear it.

06:27.680 --> 06:28.520
Auntie.

06:31.520 --> 06:32.159
Auntie.

06:41.080 --> 06:43.080
[Ye, I've got errands in town.]

06:43.440 --> 06:45.120
[Sandwiches and coffee are in the fridge.]

06:45.360 --> 06:46.680
[I left the key on the table.]

06:47.159 --> 06:48.400
[I may stay at the shop tonight.]

06:48.720 --> 06:49.840
[Remember to lock the door if you go out.]

06:56.159 --> 06:56.840
Fix your hair.

06:59.880 --> 07:00.400
Okay.

07:01.440 --> 07:04.080
Three, two, one.

07:04.520 --> 07:05.880
Cheese.

07:06.640 --> 07:08.240
Good. Very good. One more.

07:08.560 --> 07:09.600
You, come this way a little.

07:10.280 --> 07:11.840
Okay, everyone look at the camera.

07:16.520 --> 07:19.040
Three, two, one.

07:19.400 --> 07:20.720
Cheese.

07:35.840 --> 07:37.760
Go! Go! Go!

07:37.760 --> 07:38.320
Qing Ye.

07:41.480 --> 07:42.000
Go!

07:43.360 --> 07:44.000
Run forward.

07:45.600 --> 07:46.159
Catch up.

07:53.560 --> 07:54.080
Go!

08:50.760 --> 08:51.800
I'll see you off here.

08:52.280 --> 08:53.040
Good luck.

08:53.280 --> 08:53.680
Thanks.

08:53.920 --> 08:54.400
Good luck.

08:56.960 --> 08:57.640
Qing Ye.

08:58.600 --> 08:59.200
Qing Ye.

09:15.160 --> 09:16.160
In this love story

09:16.160 --> 09:17.800
of reunions and near misses,

09:18.440 --> 09:20.000
instead of missing each other once more,

09:20.760 --> 09:21.840
why not stop

09:22.600 --> 09:23.360
and return to the lighthouse

09:23.520 --> 09:24.840
where we first met?

09:26.080 --> 09:27.760
She'll follow the tide of memory

09:28.040 --> 09:28.880
back to you.

09:30.000 --> 09:30.720
Sometimes,

09:31.280 --> 09:31.880
only when you slow down

09:32.720 --> 09:34.320
can the right person find you.

11:47.800 --> 11:48.920
When I first met Xing Wu,

11:49.720 --> 11:50.800
I thought he was just

11:50.800 --> 11:52.320
with a wild, spiky haircut,

11:52.800 --> 11:54.560
a prickly rebel.

11:56.160 --> 11:57.200
After he became my cousin,

11:58.360 --> 11:59.840
he installed a door lock for me

12:00.600 --> 12:01.320
and put in an air conditioner, without asking.

12:02.280 --> 12:03.520
If we had

12:03.520 --> 12:04.720
half a chilled watermelon,

12:04.720 --> 12:05.640
it would be perfect.

12:08.520 --> 12:08.960
Eat up.

12:14.280 --> 12:16.160
He stepped forward when I was in danger.

12:17.000 --> 12:17.920
Qing Ye, it's me.

12:17.960 --> 12:19.800
He became the family I could rely on most.

12:20.920 --> 12:21.960
If you're willing,

12:22.960 --> 12:23.960
you can come back to Zhazhating with me.

12:25.000 --> 12:25.920
My home is your home.

12:27.160 --> 12:28.720
When I was at my most helpless,

12:30.120 --> 12:31.720
he gave me the warmest support.

12:34.000 --> 12:35.120
I hope the next time

12:35.120 --> 12:36.000
we meet,

12:37.560 --> 12:39.080
we'll both be our best selves.

12:39.440 --> 12:41.240
Only when reality separated us

12:41.840 --> 12:42.720
did I understand

12:43.920 --> 12:45.560
that my feelings for him

12:46.320 --> 12:48.000
had long gone beyond family.

12:48.840 --> 12:50.240
They had turned into love.

12:51.880 --> 12:53.680
Fate brought us together again.

12:54.800 --> 12:56.040
In that moment, I finally knew

12:57.160 --> 12:58.640
he was the most dazzling light

12:59.080 --> 13:00.440
in my life.

13:31.280 --> 13:32.520
Actually, I've always wanted to ask you.

13:33.320 --> 13:34.120
Back then,

13:34.480 --> 13:35.520
why didn't you apply directly

13:35.520 --> 13:36.440
to a school in Beijing?

13:37.040 --> 13:37.880
In my repeat year,

13:37.880 --> 13:39.960
a professor from a top aerospace school
contacted me.

13:40.520 --> 13:41.360
He said he admired the

13:41.360 --> 13:42.160
aircraft model I made.

13:42.760 --> 13:43.640
The one you made back then...

13:43.640 --> 13:44.680
for Ye Yingjian?

13:44.720 --> 13:45.120
Yes.

13:45.680 --> 13:46.880
That model later won an award.

13:47.200 --> 13:48.560
Ye Yingjian gave the award back to me.

13:50.000 --> 13:51.120
The professor from that school

13:51.160 --> 13:52.720
strongly recommended it.

13:53.840 --> 13:54.880
That way, you could study

13:54.880 --> 13:56.200
the major you really liked.

13:57.840 --> 13:58.800
If my grades stood out,

13:58.800 --> 14:00.000
you could enter an integrated program

14:00.920 --> 14:02.320
and work on top projects

14:02.320 --> 14:03.160
in aerospace.

14:04.400 --> 14:04.840
Yes.

14:05.200 --> 14:06.240
The prospects were better too.

14:07.960 --> 14:09.280
I gave myself four years

14:09.280 --> 14:10.280
to dig deep into my field,

14:11.320 --> 14:12.640
to earn the chance

14:12.800 --> 14:13.800
to work on projects in Beijing,

14:14.600 --> 14:16.000
and be able to stand beside you.

14:16.840 --> 14:17.640
Only then would I feel

14:17.640 --> 14:18.680
I could truly stand beside you.

14:23.880 --> 14:24.560
Back then,

14:25.520 --> 14:26.720
I heard from Shi Min

14:27.640 --> 14:28.880
you applied to that aerospace school.

14:30.200 --> 14:31.320
But I really didn't know

14:32.120 --> 14:33.720
there was so much behind it.

14:36.760 --> 14:37.800
Actually, that year,

14:39.040 --> 14:40.240
I went to Beijing to find you.

14:42.040 --> 14:42.840
You looked for me?

14:44.600 --> 14:46.160
But your school was strict.

14:47.080 --> 14:47.760
I couldn't get in.

14:48.560 --> 14:49.520
But I still waited until I saw you.

14:50.520 --> 14:51.680
I heard your roommates say

14:52.680 --> 14:53.800
you won first place

14:53.800 --> 14:54.520
in the English debate

14:55.360 --> 14:56.640
and got a national scholarship.

14:58.520 --> 14:59.880
You could have contacted me.

15:02.120 --> 15:03.240
I still had a long way

15:03.720 --> 15:04.440
to go.

15:05.680 --> 15:06.360
You said

15:07.280 --> 15:08.680
you wouldn't stop for anyone.

15:10.080 --> 15:11.080
I didn't want you

15:11.680 --> 15:12.600
to slow down for me either.

15:20.280 --> 15:21.280
Then from now on,

15:23.120 --> 15:24.040
we'll walk the road together.

15:44.600 --> 15:46.000
Why did you keep this?

15:46.160 --> 15:47.320
To buy you a house.

15:49.160 --> 15:50.360
You said that. Did you forget?

15:51.120 --> 15:52.560
When did I say that?

15:53.120 --> 15:54.200
You said it right there.

15:55.720 --> 15:56.560
Come on.

15:57.120 --> 15:58.160
Imperial green, right?

15:58.360 --> 15:59.160
Sell it.

15:59.960 --> 16:00.800
Once we sell it,

16:01.400 --> 16:03.520
we can live in a big villa.

16:05.520 --> 16:06.520
I was drunk.

16:06.520 --> 16:07.400
I was talking nonsense.

16:07.680 --> 16:08.320
I don't care.

16:08.920 --> 16:09.840
I took it seriously anyway.

16:20.640 --> 16:21.200
Cao Ping.

16:23.240 --> 16:24.160
Xing Wu.

16:24.360 --> 16:25.200
Why are you back?

16:25.880 --> 16:27.560
I was delivering goods nearby,

16:27.600 --> 16:28.760
so I brought you two boxes of seafood.

16:29.280 --> 16:29.800
Thank you.

16:29.880 --> 16:30.240
Thanks.

16:30.280 --> 16:30.680
No problem.

16:32.600 --> 16:33.800
It really has been years.

16:34.240 --> 16:35.000
Compared with before,

16:35.000 --> 16:35.840
you're completely different.

16:36.240 --> 16:36.960
Of course.

16:37.200 --> 16:38.280
He's now

16:38.280 --> 16:39.960
Manager Cao of Shi Family Seafood.

16:40.040 --> 16:40.880
Everything on Chang Island

16:40.880 --> 16:41.720
is handled by him.

16:42.040 --> 16:42.800
That impressive?

16:43.800 --> 16:44.800
I knew you can do great things.

16:44.920 --> 16:45.520
Cao Ping,

16:46.000 --> 16:47.600
come look at my TV.

16:47.600 --> 16:48.440
The screen keeps glitching.

16:48.880 --> 16:49.440
Cao Ping,

16:49.680 --> 16:50.680
my air conditioner isn't cooling.

16:50.720 --> 16:51.920
Can you check it when you have time?

16:52.360 --> 16:53.320
Sure. I'll come by later.

16:53.520 --> 16:54.120
Hurry, okay?

16:54.280 --> 16:54.920
Thanks.

16:55.120 --> 16:56.120
Ever since you left,

16:56.280 --> 16:57.400
I've taken over all this work.

16:57.920 --> 16:59.120
Actually, I used to envy you.

16:59.360 --> 17:00.080
You knew a bit of everything.

17:00.520 --> 17:02.040
So I studied some things myself

17:02.040 --> 17:02.600
and helped everyone out.

17:02.800 --> 17:04.240
I worried that after I left,

17:04.240 --> 17:05.319
there'd be no one left

17:05.319 --> 17:06.040
to handle repairs in Zhazhating.

17:06.520 --> 17:07.560
I didn't expect you to take over.

17:08.160 --> 17:09.040
Now that you're back,

17:09.079 --> 17:09.839
I'll give the work back to you.

17:09.839 --> 17:10.480
I won't fight you for it.

17:10.720 --> 17:11.160
Okay?

17:12.200 --> 17:12.599
By the way,

17:13.000 --> 17:13.920
are you free later?

17:15.000 --> 17:15.599
Let's have a little match.

17:16.720 --> 17:17.520
What are you two doing?

17:17.640 --> 17:18.240
Match in what?

17:19.560 --> 17:20.079
Relax.

17:20.520 --> 17:21.760
Purely a technical contest.

17:49.240 --> 17:49.760
Here we go.

17:51.680 --> 17:52.160
Tell me.

17:53.440 --> 17:54.000
What are we competing in?

17:55.080 --> 17:55.880
How about push-ups?

17:58.040 --> 17:59.160
Ready, start.

18:01.880 --> 18:04.400
Four, five, six, seven.

18:07.880 --> 18:09.800
Twenty, twenty-one, twenty-two.

18:10.040 --> 18:12.920
Twenty-three, twenty-four,
twenty-five, twenty-six.

18:35.200 --> 18:37.000
Fifty-eight, fifty-nine.

18:38.200 --> 18:38.920
Sixty.

18:41.680 --> 18:42.320
Congratulations.

18:43.520 --> 18:44.000
You won.

18:45.440 --> 18:46.520
You let me win, didn't you?

18:48.840 --> 18:49.640
A loss is a loss.

18:50.200 --> 18:50.960
A win is a win.

18:55.760 --> 18:57.600
Next time, let's try something else.

18:58.280 --> 18:59.040
Then next time,

18:59.320 --> 18:59.960
I'll still win.

19:05.600 --> 19:06.280
But

19:08.240 --> 19:09.040
in life,

19:09.040 --> 19:09.840
is anything ever absolute?

19:09.840 --> 19:10.520
Right, Xing Wu?

19:18.800 --> 19:19.360
Xing Wu.

19:24.400 --> 19:25.120
I'm sorry.

19:37.960 --> 19:39.200
Some people are like

19:39.800 --> 19:41.320
another version of ourselves.

19:41.840 --> 19:42.600
The clashes

19:42.600 --> 19:44.440
that once kept me up at night

19:45.240 --> 19:46.560
had softened with time

19:47.120 --> 19:47.880
and become the strength

19:48.560 --> 19:50.040
that carried me forward.

19:58.360 --> 19:59.000
I'm back.

20:02.160 --> 20:02.840
Where's Cao Ping?

20:04.000 --> 20:05.240
He said he'd go back to Chang Island

20:05.240 --> 20:06.120
after fixing the appliances.

20:07.520 --> 20:08.120
How was it?

20:08.560 --> 20:09.160
Who won?

20:09.840 --> 20:10.600
Of course, me.

20:11.360 --> 20:12.520
Nothing happened between you two, right?

20:13.360 --> 20:13.960
No.

20:14.360 --> 20:16.000
He just said he owed me an apology.

20:16.760 --> 20:17.320
It's been five years.

20:17.960 --> 20:18.640
Seeing everyone

20:18.640 --> 20:19.960
moving in a better direction,

20:20.360 --> 20:20.960
I'm happy for him.

20:22.960 --> 20:23.920
I'm happy for you too.

20:25.880 --> 20:26.400
Hungry?

20:27.880 --> 20:28.560
I'll cook.

20:30.200 --> 20:31.080
My boyfriend is going

20:31.080 --> 20:31.960
to cook for me himself?

20:32.040 --> 20:32.600
Absolutely.

20:33.040 --> 20:33.680
You haven't been

20:33.680 --> 20:34.440
eating properly in Beijing, have you?

20:34.720 --> 20:36.080
I have, sort of.

20:37.640 --> 20:39.040
Small restaurants downstairs,

20:39.320 --> 20:40.600
the company cafeteria,

20:40.880 --> 20:42.200
mall restaurants,

20:42.720 --> 20:43.880
and takeout sometimes.

20:44.280 --> 20:45.240
Don't always eat takeout.

20:45.760 --> 20:46.600
You need to eat properly.

20:46.760 --> 20:47.280
Got it?

20:48.040 --> 20:48.720
Got it.

20:49.400 --> 20:50.800
Then shouldn't you make it

20:50.800 --> 20:52.360
Michelin-chef level?

20:54.320 --> 20:54.760
Okay.

20:55.360 --> 20:56.720
For you, I'll learn to cook.

20:57.080 --> 20:58.440
Chinese and Western, alternating.

20:59.560 --> 21:00.360
That's more like it.

21:00.840 --> 21:01.680
Then I'll wait to eat.

21:01.720 --> 21:02.600
Okay. Wait for it.

21:10.360 --> 21:11.160
Help me tie my apron.

21:19.520 --> 21:20.360
Don't tie it too tight.

21:22.600 --> 21:23.280
Don't worry.

21:24.000 --> 21:24.760
So I won't delay

21:24.760 --> 21:25.760
my chance to eat good food,

21:26.440 --> 21:27.280
I tied you

21:27.280 --> 21:28.680
a nice loose bow.

21:38.800 --> 21:39.360
Hello?

21:40.120 --> 21:40.840
I knew long ago

21:40.840 --> 21:41.920
something was up with you and Xing Wu.

21:42.000 --> 21:42.880
There must be a story.

21:43.320 --> 21:43.800
Tell me.

21:44.080 --> 21:45.280
How far have you two gone?

21:45.720 --> 21:48.840
Just holding hands and hugging.

21:49.240 --> 21:50.000
Have you kissed?

21:53.840 --> 21:54.880
Not bad.

21:55.000 --> 21:55.640
How many times?

21:56.160 --> 21:56.920
Once.

21:57.360 --> 21:58.160
Only once?

21:59.240 --> 22:00.960
Don't underestimate that once.

22:01.560 --> 22:02.640
It may have been just once,

22:03.160 --> 22:05.520
but it lasted from sunset till dark.

22:05.640 --> 22:06.680
A whole hour.

22:07.800 --> 22:09.640
Qing Ye, you two are amazing.

22:10.000 --> 22:10.960
Get out of here.

22:22.840 --> 22:23.360
Hello?

22:23.560 --> 22:24.080
Xing Wu.

22:24.280 --> 22:24.960
Congratulations.

22:25.080 --> 22:25.960
Official congrats

22:25.960 --> 22:27.120
from the whole team

22:27.360 --> 22:29.080
and our best wishes.

22:29.560 --> 22:30.640
You found out so fast?

22:31.280 --> 22:32.200
My sister told me.

22:32.600 --> 22:33.160
She almost shattered

22:33.160 --> 22:34.200
my eardrums.

22:34.880 --> 22:35.600
You're about to shatter

22:35.600 --> 22:36.680
mine too.

22:37.000 --> 22:38.080
All right. I won't talk now.

22:38.080 --> 22:38.680
I'm busy.

22:39.040 --> 22:40.000
Don't brush me off.

22:40.280 --> 22:41.400
If you two get married,

22:41.560 --> 22:43.280
my sister and I get head-table seats.

22:43.600 --> 22:44.360
Sure, sure.

22:44.360 --> 22:45.440
Sit wherever you want.

22:45.960 --> 22:46.520
Hanging up.

23:07.280 --> 23:08.120
Take a break.

23:08.440 --> 23:09.040
Eat first.

23:09.760 --> 23:10.240
Soon.

24:17.760 --> 24:19.040
Where did you get that hair tie?

24:22.520 --> 24:23.720
A girl left it here.

24:24.680 --> 24:25.600
A girl?

24:28.960 --> 24:29.560
Are you mad?

24:31.440 --> 24:32.360
When was this?

24:33.280 --> 24:33.680
Who?

24:34.280 --> 24:34.960
Come clean.

24:37.520 --> 24:38.600
This girl is called

24:39.360 --> 24:39.920
Qing Ye.

24:41.280 --> 24:42.920
Five years ago, she left this hair tie

24:43.160 --> 24:44.200
in Zhazhating.

25:56.680 --> 25:57.800
It's been so long,

25:59.240 --> 26:00.120
and you still kept it.

26:01.800 --> 26:02.760
Because anything of yours

26:03.760 --> 26:04.560
is precious

26:05.280 --> 26:06.080
to me.

26:09.240 --> 26:10.160
I want a reward.

26:22.840 --> 26:23.600
Bro Wu.

26:27.640 --> 26:28.160
Bro Wu.

26:30.200 --> 26:31.200
Why are you here?

26:31.760 --> 26:33.600
We came to congratulate you.

26:33.640 --> 26:34.960
What perfect timing.

26:38.720 --> 26:40.040
You... you guys...

26:40.360 --> 26:41.040
You told them?

26:41.400 --> 26:42.200
I didn't say anything.

26:42.640 --> 26:43.080
Then...

26:43.560 --> 26:45.080
then how did you know?

27:14.800 --> 27:15.440
Here, here, here.

27:17.640 --> 27:19.280
So that's how.

27:20.520 --> 27:21.080
Bro Wu,

27:22.040 --> 27:23.320
not bad.

27:23.560 --> 27:24.520
After all these years,

27:24.520 --> 27:25.360
we finally get couple content.

27:28.840 --> 27:30.000
You're Boss Hao now,

27:30.200 --> 27:31.520
and you still remember the wild dog thing?

27:32.040 --> 27:33.120
I'm just happy.

27:33.520 --> 27:34.200
I officially announce

27:34.520 --> 27:35.960
you two are my favorite ship

27:35.960 --> 27:37.320
this year.

27:37.680 --> 27:39.240
I'm so happy, Qing Ye.

27:39.520 --> 27:40.080
See?

27:40.280 --> 27:41.320
The luck from the bouquet

27:41.320 --> 27:42.680
did pass on to you.

27:43.040 --> 27:44.440
I hope you and Bro Wu

27:44.440 --> 27:45.720
will end up together.

27:45.880 --> 27:46.560
Thank you.

27:46.560 --> 27:47.840
You even came all this way.

27:48.160 --> 27:48.760
Let's toast.

27:48.960 --> 27:50.400
Here's to happiness, love,

27:50.840 --> 27:52.800
and better days ahead.

27:53.080 --> 27:54.520
And, uh, may your career thrive.

27:56.560 --> 27:57.720
Come on, cheers, cheers.

27:57.840 --> 27:59.160
Cheers.

28:05.680 --> 28:06.520
Manager Qing,

28:07.360 --> 28:08.240
you're really busy.

28:09.880 --> 28:11.520
Mine are small matters.

28:11.520 --> 28:12.600
How can I compare with you?

28:13.200 --> 28:14.280
Your work

28:14.280 --> 28:15.280
literally goes up into the sky.

28:16.520 --> 28:17.600
Go ahead and tease me.

28:19.120 --> 28:20.560
I'm telling the truth.

28:23.680 --> 28:24.800
I guess you're not wrong.

28:32.360 --> 28:33.240
I'll pick you up tonight.

28:34.880 --> 28:35.920
You're not working overtime today, right?

28:36.120 --> 28:36.680
No overtime.

28:37.000 --> 28:38.440
Okay. I'm going to the company.

28:42.520 --> 28:42.960
Bye.

28:43.280 --> 28:43.760
Bye.

28:52.120 --> 28:53.200
The due diligence on Chang Island

28:53.320 --> 28:54.240
is going very smoothly.

28:54.680 --> 28:55.520
The aquaculture farm owners

28:55.520 --> 28:56.880
are all highly willing to cooperate.

28:57.200 --> 28:58.160
We've completed the survey.

28:58.240 --> 28:59.400
It's already in the final stage.

29:01.360 --> 29:02.160
Qing Ye,

29:02.520 --> 29:03.680
I truly admire

29:03.680 --> 29:04.920
your ability to find gold.

29:06.440 --> 29:07.520
Whether our group can win

29:07.520 --> 29:08.520
the top prize internally this year

29:08.800 --> 29:09.880
depends on how wide

29:09.960 --> 29:10.800
you can cast this net.

29:11.360 --> 29:12.080
Don't worry, boss.

29:12.280 --> 29:13.320
I'll do my best.

29:13.640 --> 29:14.320
That issue from last time

29:14.320 --> 29:15.000
has been solved, right?

29:15.120 --> 29:15.880
It's solved.

29:16.760 --> 29:17.760
Any other problems now?

29:21.200 --> 29:21.920
The project Professor Lu

29:21.920 --> 29:22.920
assigned to your side...

29:23.360 --> 29:24.920
How far along are you now?

29:25.000 --> 29:25.640
I'm at about

29:25.640 --> 29:26.360
fifty percent.

29:42.800 --> 29:44.280
Finally finished.

29:45.040 --> 29:45.960
We're home too.

29:46.760 --> 29:47.800
I'm exhausted.

29:47.800 --> 29:49.280
Battery drained.

29:50.320 --> 29:50.880
I can't walk anymore.

29:53.120 --> 29:53.920
You don't have to walk.

30:05.560 --> 30:06.000
Come here.

30:11.720 --> 30:12.520
What do you want for dinner?

30:13.080 --> 30:13.960
Seafood noodles.

30:14.480 --> 30:14.920
Seafood noodles.

30:15.320 --> 30:16.000
What else?

30:16.640 --> 30:17.560
Sea urchin egg custard.

30:31.520 --> 30:31.960
Dad.

30:32.520 --> 30:33.160
Hello, Uncle.

30:36.200 --> 30:37.000
Wait for me a second.

30:59.160 --> 31:00.440
I really like Xing Wu.

31:01.760 --> 31:03.360
I'm happy being with him.

31:03.960 --> 31:04.960
I can tell.

31:06.800 --> 31:08.280
You insisted on staying in Beijing.

31:08.280 --> 31:09.120
Was it because of him?

31:12.360 --> 31:13.280
Not entirely.

31:13.880 --> 31:15.520
I made that decision

31:15.840 --> 31:17.120
after thinking carefully

31:17.440 --> 31:18.520
about my future.

31:20.320 --> 31:21.000
When I brought you

31:21.000 --> 31:22.400
back from Zhazhating,

31:23.360 --> 31:24.640
I lent their family some money.

31:24.640 --> 31:25.240
Did you know that?

31:31.520 --> 31:32.400
A few years later,

31:32.400 --> 31:33.520
he gave me this card.

31:33.880 --> 31:35.000
There was 150,000 in it.

31:35.880 --> 31:36.840
He paid back everything

31:36.840 --> 31:37.920
the money I gave his family

31:37.960 --> 31:39.560
for taking care of you,

31:40.200 --> 31:41.040
plus the Xuan Island renovation costs,

31:41.840 --> 31:42.960
with interest, all in one payment.

31:49.240 --> 31:49.680
He...

31:50.880 --> 31:52.400
Where did he get so much money?

31:55.200 --> 31:56.720
He said it was

31:56.720 --> 31:57.360
patent royalties from those years.

31:58.200 --> 31:59.240
But you can imagine

32:00.240 --> 32:01.080
it must also have been money

32:01.640 --> 32:03.200
he saved by living frugally.

32:05.880 --> 32:07.000
After all,

32:07.000 --> 32:08.040
I failed in my own marriage too.

32:09.080 --> 32:11.520
Who you date is your decision.

32:12.280 --> 32:13.440
I won't interfere too much.

32:15.040 --> 32:16.920
But one fact can't be denied.

32:18.440 --> 32:20.040
There are real gaps

32:20.080 --> 32:21.160
between our two families

32:21.680 --> 32:23.520
in many ways.

32:27.400 --> 32:28.240
I'm worried

32:28.880 --> 32:29.880
that as you spend time together,

32:29.880 --> 32:31.440
you'll face many conflicts.

32:44.160 --> 32:45.760
To catch up with my pace,

32:46.200 --> 32:47.120
he was willing to wait five years.

32:48.440 --> 32:49.440
So I believe,

32:50.240 --> 32:51.120
no matter what,

32:52.400 --> 32:53.840
he'll work hard enough

32:53.840 --> 32:55.000
to bridge every gap.

33:13.360 --> 33:14.280
What did your dad say?

33:14.840 --> 33:15.920
He's not angry, is he?

33:17.720 --> 33:18.320
No.

33:19.000 --> 33:19.640
Let's talk when we get home.

33:20.080 --> 33:20.560
Come on.

33:37.400 --> 33:38.560
What are you making for me?

33:39.960 --> 33:40.680
Seafood noodles.

33:45.520 --> 33:47.560
Can you make baked pumpkin custard?

33:50.360 --> 33:51.000
I'll look it up.

33:59.840 --> 34:00.840
Do you have lemons at home?

34:01.320 --> 34:02.040
Maybe in the fridge.

34:08.199 --> 34:08.719
Are there any?

34:10.400 --> 34:11.159
I can't find them.

34:22.120 --> 34:22.719
Found them?

34:24.040 --> 34:27.360
I found milk and white sugar.

34:28.040 --> 34:28.679
Will that work?

35:03.200 --> 35:04.200
It's so good.

35:04.680 --> 35:05.760
I didn't know Beibei pumpkin

35:05.760 --> 35:06.640
could be made this way.

35:07.440 --> 35:08.680
I'll make it for you whenever you want.

35:08.720 --> 35:09.120
Okay.

35:13.480 --> 35:14.520
I only found out today

35:15.200 --> 35:16.840
that you've been repaying money for years.

35:18.080 --> 35:18.560
If my dad

35:18.760 --> 35:20.120
hadn't told me today,

35:20.520 --> 35:21.440
were you

35:21.760 --> 35:22.800
never going to tell me?

35:24.960 --> 35:25.880
Your dad told you everything?

35:28.760 --> 35:30.160
Most of it was

35:30.160 --> 35:31.920
scholarship money from school,

35:32.360 --> 35:33.280
patent royalties and things like that.

35:33.680 --> 35:34.320
It's not worth mentioning.

35:37.440 --> 35:38.120
Xing Wu.

35:39.600 --> 35:40.840
You've had a hard time all these years.

35:43.400 --> 35:44.640
What else did your dad tell you?

35:45.280 --> 35:47.360
Was he strongly against

35:47.360 --> 35:48.120
us being together?

35:50.640 --> 35:53.360
Not against it,

35:55.000 --> 35:56.160
but not exactly supportive either.

35:56.960 --> 35:57.600
It's just...

35:58.440 --> 36:00.320
he's still a little worried.

36:23.840 --> 36:25.360
To catch up with my pace,

36:25.800 --> 36:26.760
he was willing to wait five years.

36:28.080 --> 36:29.120
So I believe,

36:30.160 --> 36:31.040
no matter what,

36:32.320 --> 36:33.360
in the future,

36:33.360 --> 36:34.920
he'll work hard to bridge every gap.

36:36.960 --> 36:38.520
Are you sure you won't regret it?

36:39.800 --> 36:40.640
In your words,

36:40.640 --> 36:42.200
you're dating down.

36:44.680 --> 36:45.640
For the same question,

36:46.800 --> 36:48.120
my mom had an answer too.

36:50.560 --> 36:51.200
She said

36:52.240 --> 36:53.440
Love is a bet you choose to make,

36:53.840 --> 36:55.200
and whatever happens, you own it.

36:56.120 --> 36:58.000
She gave it everything she had

36:58.400 --> 36:59.840
and stayed true to herself.

37:01.000 --> 37:02.520
Even if it didn't work out,

37:03.680 --> 37:05.680
she never regretted having loved him.

37:13.240 --> 37:13.800
Qing Ye,

37:14.520 --> 37:15.560
in a few days,

37:15.800 --> 37:17.080
I plan to visit your dad.

37:18.280 --> 37:19.200
After all, with some things,

37:19.440 --> 37:20.520
taking the first step yourself

37:20.720 --> 37:21.880
is what shows real sincerity.

37:26.840 --> 37:28.280
Bring him home sometime.

37:29.360 --> 37:29.840
See?

37:31.640 --> 37:32.680
What a coincidence.

37:34.280 --> 37:35.440
He wants to meet you too.

37:40.640 --> 37:41.880
I've finally waited for this day.

37:42.680 --> 37:43.280
Don't worry.

37:43.760 --> 37:44.520
I'm ready.

37:47.640 --> 37:48.520
I believe in you.

37:49.200 --> 37:50.000
And I believe in myself.

37:51.320 --> 37:52.200
Come on. Cheers.

37:59.560 --> 38:00.520
Easy.

38:00.800 --> 38:01.760
You can't hold your liquor.

38:02.600 --> 38:03.680
How can you say I can't?

38:03.680 --> 38:04.520
That was before.

38:04.520 --> 38:05.720
Now I can drink really well.

38:08.160 --> 38:09.000
Do you remember what you're like

38:09.000 --> 38:09.520
when you're drunk?

38:09.880 --> 38:10.640
In Zhazhating?

38:13.200 --> 38:13.800
What did I do?

38:13.960 --> 38:15.600
There was an abandoned boat by the sea.

38:16.400 --> 38:17.680
You insisted on dragging me onto it.

38:17.720 --> 38:19.040
You said, Captain, set sail.

38:19.280 --> 38:19.880
And called me

38:20.280 --> 38:20.920
Jack.

38:21.640 --> 38:22.760
Me, Rose.

38:23.040 --> 38:24.120
Jack.

38:25.240 --> 38:25.880
Rose.

38:26.240 --> 38:26.840
Jack.

38:27.160 --> 38:27.680
Rose.

38:27.720 --> 38:28.520
Did I?

38:28.520 --> 38:29.520
I did not. You did.

38:29.520 --> 38:30.400
That was still the mild part.

38:30.440 --> 38:31.560
Then you

38:32.120 --> 38:33.120
insisted on performing for me.

38:33.520 --> 38:34.280
What did I perform?

38:35.160 --> 38:36.040
the Monkey King's birth scene.

38:43.320 --> 38:44.520
Don't give me a play-by-play.

38:44.520 --> 38:45.400
I hate when people do

38:45.400 --> 38:45.920
drunk recaps.

38:45.920 --> 38:46.840
And the Little Swan dance.

38:47.560 --> 38:48.520
Good. Today,

38:49.520 --> 38:50.240
let's settle this.

38:50.440 --> 38:50.840
Come on.

38:51.000 --> 38:51.440
Come on.

38:51.520 --> 38:52.000
Come on.

39:12.680 --> 39:13.800
I want to build a plane.

39:14.160 --> 39:16.240
I want to build the biggest,

39:17.000 --> 39:18.520
tallest plane.

39:18.760 --> 39:19.960
Do you know? From here,

39:20.520 --> 39:22.520
I can fly a paper plane to...

39:22.640 --> 39:23.240
To where?

39:23.320 --> 39:23.920
Haidian.

39:24.080 --> 39:24.720
This is Haidian.

39:24.720 --> 39:26.000
You're flying to Haidian?

39:26.400 --> 39:27.760
Do you know, before,

39:28.920 --> 39:29.800
I wanted to fly.

39:30.040 --> 39:31.120
Now I don't.

39:31.360 --> 39:32.160
Then where do you want to go?

39:32.240 --> 39:33.440
Guess what I want to do now.

39:33.680 --> 39:34.360
I don't know.

39:34.360 --> 39:35.080
Tell me.

39:35.680 --> 39:38.440
Now I want to leave Earth,

39:39.040 --> 39:39.880
fly into the universe,

39:40.720 --> 39:41.880
fly into outer space.

39:42.920 --> 39:43.760
Outer space?

39:44.240 --> 39:44.920
Where are you going?

39:45.080 --> 39:45.920
Do you want to go?

39:46.600 --> 39:47.400
Will you take me?

39:47.760 --> 39:48.480
Of course.

39:49.000 --> 39:50.200
Of course I'll take you.

39:50.920 --> 39:51.360
Okay.

39:51.560 --> 39:52.400
Really?

39:52.440 --> 39:53.640
Of course it's real.

39:53.760 --> 39:55.680
I'll build a plane, then a rocket.

39:55.840 --> 39:56.920
Then we'll go to outer space.

39:57.080 --> 39:57.760
We'll elope.

39:58.680 --> 39:59.800
We're done playing on Earth.

40:00.240 --> 40:00.720
Okay.

40:00.880 --> 40:01.520
I believe you.

40:01.640 --> 40:02.600
Can I believe you?

40:02.920 --> 40:04.400
When Jack says something,

40:04.680 --> 40:05.840
he means it.

40:06.280 --> 40:06.800
Good.

40:07.400 --> 40:08.320
Then from now on,

40:08.600 --> 40:10.040
Rose won't jump either.

40:10.280 --> 40:13.000
She'll follow Jack and fly.

40:13.720 --> 40:14.880
Fly.

40:15.120 --> 40:16.160
Fly.

40:16.520 --> 40:17.400
Fly.

40:18.760 --> 40:19.400
Fly.

40:22.000 --> 40:22.960
My old dream

40:22.960 --> 40:24.520
was to soar into the sky.

40:26.520 --> 40:27.160
Impressive.

40:27.560 --> 40:28.680
Do you want to soar into the sky?

40:29.160 --> 40:30.120
How would I soar into the sky?

40:30.720 --> 40:31.320
Climb up.

40:31.880 --> 40:32.520
Get down.

40:33.040 --> 40:33.640
Climb up.

40:33.680 --> 40:34.680
You'll fall.

40:36.240 --> 40:37.280
How do I soar into the sky?

40:51.840 --> 40:52.520
Nervous?

40:53.560 --> 40:54.160
A little.

40:54.840 --> 40:55.880
First time meeting the family.

40:55.920 --> 40:56.680
No experience.

40:57.400 --> 40:59.080
It's my first time bringing a boyfriend

40:59.120 --> 40:59.960
home to meet my dad too.

41:00.040 --> 41:01.120
I don't have much experience either.

41:01.960 --> 41:03.560
Then two negatives make a positive.

41:04.880 --> 41:05.600
What if my dad

41:06.080 --> 41:07.400
sets a trap for me?

41:08.600 --> 41:09.840
Then I'll elope with you.

41:11.400 --> 41:11.880
Not bad.

41:12.160 --> 41:13.080
I knew I chose the right person.

41:13.840 --> 41:14.280
Let's go.

41:20.320 --> 41:20.760
Dad.

41:21.240 --> 41:22.560
Mr. Qing, Ye is back.

41:22.840 --> 41:23.360
Hello, Mr. Qing.

41:29.040 --> 41:30.200
Give that to me. I'll carry it.

41:30.200 --> 41:31.040
Okay. Thank you.

41:32.120 --> 41:32.600
You're here.

41:34.520 --> 41:35.000
Do you have time?

41:35.320 --> 41:35.720
Yes.

41:36.880 --> 41:37.560
Do me a favor.

41:41.240 --> 41:42.160
I'll go over first.

41:49.120 --> 41:49.600
Auntie,

41:49.760 --> 41:51.160
what has my dad been busy with lately?

41:51.560 --> 41:53.120
Lately,

41:53.120 --> 41:53.640
he's always in the garden.

41:55.040 --> 41:56.160
He started planting flowers.

42:02.520 --> 42:03.440
Do you know how to grow flowers?

42:04.560 --> 42:05.080
Uncle,

42:05.520 --> 42:06.880
I grew up in the countryside.

42:07.000 --> 42:08.520
I've grown wheat and corn.

42:08.840 --> 42:10.120
I learned some basic gardening too.

42:10.360 --> 42:11.040
I can grow flowers.

42:11.920 --> 42:12.280
Right.

42:12.800 --> 42:14.280
The Welwitschia Qing Ye

42:14.280 --> 42:15.120
brought back to Zhazhating...

42:15.120 --> 42:15.840
After the fire,

42:16.400 --> 42:17.320
I saved it.

42:21.040 --> 42:22.400
That Welwitschia is still alive?

42:22.920 --> 42:23.360
Yes.

42:29.320 --> 42:30.320
This garden

42:31.320 --> 42:32.120
used to be taken care of

42:32.120 --> 42:33.160
by Ye's mother.

42:33.840 --> 42:35.280
As for these flowers and plants,

42:35.520 --> 42:37.720
how much water, how deep to plant them,

42:37.720 --> 42:38.520
I can't figure it out.

42:39.120 --> 42:40.360
So I bought some seeds.

42:41.960 --> 42:42.840
I planted them four or five days ago,

42:42.840 --> 42:43.640
but they still haven't sprouted.

42:43.640 --> 42:44.240
Take a look for me.

42:44.600 --> 42:45.720
What you planted is...

42:46.840 --> 42:47.360
Just these.

42:53.240 --> 42:54.520
Tulips aren't really suitable

42:54.520 --> 42:55.520
for summer planting.

42:55.880 --> 42:56.680
High temperatures

42:56.800 --> 42:58.160
affect their dormancy

42:58.160 --> 42:59.000
and flower-bud development.

43:00.000 --> 43:01.400
This plumbago is more suitable.

43:01.880 --> 43:02.520
It likes to grow

43:02.520 --> 43:03.680
in places with plenty of sunlight.

43:04.520 --> 43:06.000
But when it gets too hot in summer,

43:06.280 --> 43:07.240
it also needs proper shade.

43:08.080 --> 43:08.760
Put it here.

43:11.680 --> 43:12.200
Looks like

43:12.880 --> 43:14.320
things with different natures

43:15.280 --> 43:16.400
shouldn't be forced together.

43:17.680 --> 43:18.760
Then throw it away.

43:20.120 --> 43:20.760
No need for that.

43:22.800 --> 43:23.600
Uncle, how about this?

43:25.160 --> 43:26.200
We'll need some clay pebbles.
